			id: "4190000000000001"
			title: "Temperature Changes the Process"
			description: ["The Electrical Furnace milestone is the point where temperature becomes an explicit engineering variable. Composition tells you what a material contains; it does not specify melting range, atmosphere, phase transitions, heat treatment or microstructure. High-temperature metallurgy is therefore a process discipline, not generic chemical synthesis."]
