			id: "4190000000000002"
			title: "Dedicated Alloy Smelting"
			description: ["Build the Matterworks-gated NuclearCraft Alloy Smelter. Its machine recipe requires the electrical furnace, engineered graphite, reinforced control material and electromechanical control hardware. This is the entry point for the high-temperature branch, not an early side machine."]
