			title: "Process Ownership Boundaries"
			description: ["The 0.5.7 Industrial branch promotes validated high-temperature materials into explicit process ownership, but that does not legalise every stock molten shortcut. Superconductors, ceramic-matrix composites, refractory systems and high-pressure carbon routes still require physically meaningful production paths before any quarantined edge can return."]
